msgid "Unwrap (Organic)"
msgstr "展开 (有机材质)"

msgid "Reads the model, decides where it has to be cut, and lays every piece out flat with as little pull in it as the shape allows."
msgstr "读取模型，决定切割位置，并以形状允许的最小拉伸将其平铺."

msgid "Which projector"
msgstr "选择哪个投影器"

msgid "Auto Unwrap cuts along the model's own lines and as little as the shape allows, keeps mirrored parts together and shares their texture. Blender is its own Smart UV Project, kept here as a fallback."
msgstr "自动展开沿模型的线条进行切割，在保持镜像部分在一起并共享其纹理的同时尽可能少地拉伸。Blender 自带的智能 UV 投射保存在这里作为备选方案。"

msgid "Optimize layout"
msgstr "优化布局"

msgid "After the flattening the layout is worked on: panels are straightened onto their own grid, a sheet is broken into the panels it is made of, and an island that runs the length of the square is cut into blocks. On a model built out of even quad panels this fills the sheet and is worth it. On a model it misreads it takes a flattening that was already right and cuts it about. Turn it off and what came out of the flattening is what gets packed."
msgstr "在平铺之后对布局进行处理：面板被拉直到各自的网格上，一张片被拆分成它由的面板组成，而沿着正方形延伸的岛屿被切割成块状。对于由四边形面板构建的模型，这会填满整个图纸并值得这么做。对于一个错误的模型，它会取一个已经是正确的平铺结果并将其裁剪。关闭它则平铺的结果会被打包."

msgid "Piece size"
msgstr "片段大小"

msgid "How much curvature one island may swallow. Higher gives fewer, larger islands and a little more stretch; lower gives more islands that lie flatter."
msgstr "单个岛屿可以吞噬多少曲率。更高的值会产生更少、更大的岛屿和略多的拉伸；更低的值会产生更多以平面方式排列的岛屿。"

msgid "Smart UV (Hardsurface)"
msgstr "智能 UV (刚性表面)"

msgid "Unwraps with Blender's own Smart UV Project instead of the organic engine, one part at a time. For a busy hard surface model, where the slow unwrap buys nothing anyone will see."
msgstr "使用 Blender 自带的智能 UV 投射而不是有机引擎，一次处理一个部分。对于繁忙的刚性表面模型来说，缓慢的展开不会带来任何人会注意到的收益。"

msgid "Angle limit"
msgstr "角度限制"

msgid "How far a face may lean from its neighbour before Smart UV Project starts a new island. Lower cuts more often and leaves flatter pieces."
msgstr "面可以偏离邻居多远才会启动智能 UV 投影并创建新岛屿。降低该值会更频繁地切割，留下更扁平的片段。"

msgid "Island margin"
msgstr "岛屿边距"

msgid "The gap Smart UV Project leaves around each island before the layout is packed."
msgstr "Smart UV 项目在布局打包前会在每个岛屿周围留下的间隙。"

msgid "Area weight"
msgstr "区域权重"

msgid "How much a face's size counts when the projection directions are chosen. High lets the big faces decide."
msgstr "面片大小在选择投影方向时所占的比重。高值会让大面片占据主导地位."

msgid "Correct aspect"
msgstr "正确比例"

msgid "Takes the image's shape into account, so a texture that is not square does not come out stretched."
msgstr "考虑图像的形状，这样非正方形的贴图不会出现拉伸变形."

msgid "Fewer pieces or less stretch"
msgstr "更少面片或更少的拉伸"

msgid "Cutting less and stretching less pull against each other. Fewer leaves larger islands for somebody to work in by hand; Smoother cuts wherever it helps the shapes, whatever that costs in extra pieces; Balanced is the middle, and the default."
msgstr "减少切割和减少拉伸会相互抵消。更少意味着留更大的岛屿让人手动操作；平滑的切割无论以何种代价都能更好地适应形状；平衡是中间值，也是默认设置。"

msgid "How much the layout pulls the model about"
msgstr "布局对模型产生何种影响？|||~|||蓝色表示表面从布局中延伸出，其形状与放入的贴图一致，并采用棋盘格作为基础。越接近红色，"

msgid "Blue is a surface that comes out of the layout the shape it went in, and takes a checker map as squares. The further towards red, the more that face is stretched: at red it is coming out twice as long one way as the other, and a texture painted on it will smear. Click again to go back to the normal view."
msgstr "蓝色是布局中形状的表面，并以棋盘格图作为方格。越靠近红色，该面被拉伸得越多：在红色处，它在一个方向上比另一个方向长两倍，绘制在其上的纹理会模糊。再次点击可返回正常视图。"

msgid "Repeated parts share one place"
msgstr "重复的部分共享一个位置"

msgid "A tank's track links, a panel's hundred identical screws - they are the same part, so they get one place on the sheet and the texture spends its resolution once instead of a hundred times. Off unless you switch it on: once copies are stacked they cannot be painted apart, so it is a decision about the model rather than a default."
msgstr "坦克履带连接件、面板上的一百个相同螺丝——它们是同一个部件，因此它们在图纸上有同一位置，纹理的分辨率只被使用一次而不是一百次。除非您将其打开：一旦副本堆叠在一起就无法分别绘制，所以这是一个关于模型的决定而非默认设置。"

msgid "A mirrored part counts as a repeat"
msgstr "镜像部件也算作重复"

msgid "On a vehicle most of what repeats is not a copy but a mirror, the left of the car against the right, and that is usually where the sheet is really saved. A mirrored part reads its texture the other way round, which nobody sees on a symmetrical part and everybody sees on one with writing across it."
msgstr "在车辆上，大部分重复的内容不是复制品而是镜像——汽车的左侧对应右侧，而纹理通常就保存在那里。镜像部分会以相反的方向读取其纹理，这在对称部件上是看不见的，但在带有文字的表面上一眼就能看出来。"

msgid "How tiles are filled"
msgstr "瓦片是如何填充的"

msgid "Object keeps every object whole on one tile - tracks here, hull there, which is how a vehicle is textured. Balanced deals out the islands instead, so every tile carries the same amount of surface and the texel density is even, but an object may be spread over several tiles."
msgstr "对象在单个瓦片上保持完整——这里有轨道，那里有船体，这正是车辆贴图的方式。平衡的分配则相反，它将岛屿分散到各个瓦片中，因此每个瓦片的表面积相同且纹理密度均匀，但一个对象可能会分布在多个瓦片上。"

msgid "UDIM tiles"
msgstr "UDIM 瓦片"

msgid "How many tiles the layout is spread over. Above one, whole parts are dealt out by area - 1001, 1002, 1003 - so each tile carries about the same surface and the detail stays even."
msgstr "布局所覆盖的瓦片数量。在上方，整体部分按面积分配——1001、1002、1003——因此每个瓦片的表面积大致相同，细节保持均匀。"

msgid "Bakes the material into an image that follows the new UV layout, so the model carries its look as a texture."
msgstr "将材质烘焙为跟随新 UV 布局的图像，使模型携带其外观作为纹理。"

msgid "Hard surface, organic engine"
msgstr "硬表面、有机引擎"

msgid "Some hard surface models come out better from Unwrap (Organic) than from Smart UV. It depends on how the model was built: a panel made of long even quad grids suits Smart UV, while a shape modelled in one piece, smoothed, or rebuilt from a scan or an AI mesh, often has no clean panels to read and the organic engine reads it better. If the layout comes out broken into many small pieces, try the other engine on the same model."
msgstr "某些硬表面模型从 Unwrap（有机）比从 Smart UV 表现更好。这取决于模型的构建方式：由长而均匀的四边形网格组成的面板适合 Smart UV；而用单一部件建模、平滑或从扫描/AI 网格重建的形状，往往没有清晰的板面可供读取，因此有机引擎能更好地处理它。如果布局被分割成许多小块，请尝试在相同模型上使用另一个引擎。"

msgid "Parts at 1"
msgstr "1 个部件"

msgid "At 1 the whole model is one piece and the engine decides every seam on its own, wherever the shape asks for it. More parts put borders the cutting cannot find by itself. Keep in mind the engine can be wrong: look the seams over, and Pick Islands On Model or Join Into One are there to put it right."
msgstr "当为 1 时，整个模型视为一个整体，引擎会自行决定所有接缝的位置——无论形状需要何处。更多的部件会使切割无法自动找到的边界增多。请记住引擎可能会出错：检查接缝，并可使用“在模型上拾取岛屿”或“合并为一个”来修正它。"

msgid "Stops the run that is going on now. The model is left as it was before it started."
msgstr "停止当前正在进行的运行。模型将保持其原始状态。"

msgid "Preview seams"
msgstr "预览接缝"

msgid "Shows where the cuts would run before anything is unwrapped, so you can look them over first."
msgstr "在未进行任何 UV 展开之前显示切割路径的位置，以便您先查看它们。"

msgid "Show parts"
msgstr "显示部件"

msgid "Paints the pieces the add-on found onto the model, each in its own colour. Press again and the colours come off."
msgstr "将附加组件找到的模型部件涂成各自的颜色。再次按此键即可去除颜色。"

msgid "Pick and merge"
msgstr "拾取与合并"

msgid "Click a piece in the viewport, then the next one. The two become one piece, and Confirm keeps it."
msgstr "在视口中点击一个对象，然后点击下一个。这两个将合并为一个对象，确认会保留它。"

msgid "Merge selected"
msgstr "合并选中项"

msgid "Everything selected in the viewport is made into one piece, so it is unwrapped as a single island."
msgstr "视图中的所有选定对象都被合并为一个整体，因此它们被作为单个岛屿进行展开。"

msgid "Split off"
msgstr "分离"

msgid "Turns the selected faces into a piece of their own, cut away from the piece they were part of."
msgstr "将选中的面转换为独立部分，将其从所属的部件中分离出来。"

msgid "Reset pieces"
msgstr "重置部件"

msgid "Throws away the merges and splits you made by hand and goes back to what the add-on found on its own."
msgstr "丢弃您手动创建的合并和拆分，并恢复到附加程序自行找到的状态。"

msgid "Less Stretch"
msgstr "较少拉伸"

msgid "Cut wherever it helps, whatever that costs in seams. The checker comes out square all over the model and there are more orange lines to hide."
msgstr "在需要时任意切割，即使这会增加接缝。棋盘格会在模型的所有面上都呈现正方形，并且有更多的橙色线条来隐藏。"

msgid "The middle of the trade: cut again where the flattening really went wrong, leave the rest carrying a little pull."
msgstr "贸易的中间：再次切割，在真正出错的扁平化处切断，其余部分保留一点拉力。"

msgid "Fewer Seams"
msgstr "更少的接缝"

msgid "Keep the model whole and take the pull that comes with it. Larger islands, fewer orange lines, a checker that leans where the shape curves."
msgstr "保持模型完整，并承受随之而来的拉力。更大的岛屿，更少的橙色线条，棋盘格顺着形状的弯曲方向倾斜。"

msgid "Every object stays whole on one tile - tracks on this tile, hull on that one. The usual choice for a vehicle or a set, where each part is textured on its own."
msgstr "每个对象在一个瓦片上保持完整——该瓦片上的轨道，另一个瓦片上的外壳。这是车辆或一组物体的通常选择，其中每个部分单独进行纹理贴图。"

msgid "The islands are dealt out by area instead, so every tile carries about the same amount of surface and the texel density stays even across the whole set. An object can end up spread over two tiles."
msgstr "岛屿按面积分配，因此每个瓦片承载大约相同数量的表面，整个集合的 texel 密度保持一致。一个对象可能会分布在两个瓦片上。"

msgid "Follow Parts Exactly"
msgstr "完全跟随部件"

msgid "On, the unwrap starts from the very parts Show Parts draws and keeps every border between them: it still cuts inside a part where a piece has to be opened to lie flat, but it never joins two parts back together and never throws the segmentation away to cut the model again its own way. Off, the parts are a starting point and the engine reworks them, which gives fewer pieces on a model you have not segmented by hand."
msgstr "开启时，展开从“显示部件”绘制的非常具体的部分开始，并保持它们之间的所有边界：它仍然在必须打开以使某一部分平铺的地方内部切割，但它永远不会将两个部分重新连接在一起，也绝不会放弃分段以按自己的方式再次切割模型。关闭时，部件只是起点，引擎会对其重新处理，这会在未手动分段的模型上产生更少的碎片。"

msgid "UV Orientation"
msgstr "UV 方向"

msgid "Every island is laid so that one direction in the world points up the sheet. Straightening already squares an island on the grid, but four ways up are equally square, and a texture with a grain in it cares which one: rain running down a panel, a drip of rust, the grain of a plank, the brush marks on steel. With this on the packer may not turn islands, so the sheet fills a little less tightly. It applies to the packing at the end of an unwrap and to the Repack button alike."
msgstr "每个岛屿都放置得使世界中的一个方向指向纸张的上方。将岛屿在网格上拉直已经将其正方形化，但四个方向都是同样正方形的，而带有纹理颗粒的贴图关心的是哪一个：雨水顺着面板流下、锈迹滴落、木板的纹理、钢上的刷痕。开启此选项时，打包器可能不会旋转岛屿，因此纸张填充得稍紧一些。它适用于展开结束时的打包以及“重新打包”按钮。"

msgid "Which way in the world points up the sheet. Z is up, which is the one rain runs down."
msgstr "世界上的哪个方向是纸张的上方？Z 轴向上，也就是雨水流下的那个方向。"

msgid "Mirror Axis"
msgstr "镜像轴"

msgid "Which way the mirror plane faces. Auto looks for the plane the model is symmetric about, in any direction, which costs a search over every vertex. Naming the axis skips that and puts the plane through the middle of the model."
msgstr "镜平面的朝向。Auto 会查找模型关于哪个方向对称的平面，这需要遍历每个顶点进行搜索。命名轴可以跳过该步骤，并将平面置于模型的中间。"

msgid "Slide the plane off the middle, as a share of the model's half width along that axis. Zero is the middle, one is the edge."
msgstr "将平面沿该轴方向从模型的一半宽度处滑出。零是中心，一是对边缘。"

msgid "Seam On Mirror Plane"
msgstr "镜面上的接缝"

msgid "The line down the middle is cut first and every other cut is placed against it, which is where an artist hides it. Off, the flattener opens the model wherever it costs least, and on a symmetric model that is usually a line beside the middle rather than on it. On costs a few more islands, because nothing is left lying across the plane."
msgstr "中间的线先切，其余的切口都放在它旁边，艺术家就藏在那儿。然后，压平器会在成本最低的地方打开模型，对于对称模型来说，通常是在中线的一侧而不是在线上。这样会增加几个岛屿，因为平面两侧没有东西了。"

msgid "Show Mirror Plane"
msgstr "显示镜像平面"

msgid "Draw the plane on the model, so you can see which way it is being folded before anything is unwrapped. The line under it says how much of the surface actually has a twin across that plane - under a third and nothing is mirrored."
msgstr "在模型上绘制平面，以便在展开之前可以看到折叠的方向。下方的线显示有多少表面实际上在该平面的另一侧有镜像——不到三分之一，没有任何部分被镜像。"

msgid "A model that mirrors is cut the same on both sides, and the two sides land as mirrored islands. A piece the plane runs through is not cut twice."
msgstr "镜像模型在两侧被切割，两侧作为镜像岛屿落地。平面穿过的部分不会被切割两次。"

msgid "Chunk size"
msgstr "块大小"

msgid "How many faces go into one chunk. Smaller is lighter on memory, larger is quicker where the machine can take it."
msgstr "每个 chunk 包含多少个面。数量越小，内存占用越少；数量越大，机器处理得越快。"

msgid "Pack islands"
msgstr "打包岛屿"

msgid "Gathers the flattened pieces into the square, turning and fitting them so as little of it is left empty as can be."
msgstr "将扁平化的碎片收集到正方形中，通过旋转和排列使剩余空白尽可能少。"

msgid "The gap kept between packed pieces, so a texture does not bleed from one island into the next."
msgstr "已打包的碎片之间保留的空隙，防止纹理从一个岛屿溢出到下一个。"

msgid "Relax steps"
msgstr "松弛步骤"

msgid "How many passes of evening-out a piece is given after it is flattened. More settles it further and costs time."
msgstr "在扁平化后对每个碎片进行多少次平滑处理。次数越多，结果越平整，但耗时也越长。"

msgid "Packs the whole layout again, every selected object together. Use it after redoing islands by hand: a piece that comes back a different size leaves gaps, and this places everything properly again. Nothing leaves its UDIM tile, nothing is flattened again, stacked copies stay stacked. Select the islands you want packed before you press it, all of them and not just the one you were working on: it packs what it is given."
msgstr "重新打包整个布局，将所有选中对象一起打包。适用于手动重做岛屿后：某个碎片恢复时尺寸发生变化会留下空隙，此操作可将其正确归位。不会移动任何碎片的 UDIM 贴图区域，也不会再次扁平化或堆叠副本。请在点击前选择好要打包的岛屿（全部或部分），它只会打包您选中的内容。"

msgid "Match Existing UV"
msgstr "匹配现有 UV"

msgid "Reads the seams out of the UV map the model already carries and unwraps along them, so the pieces land where that layout put them, with our texel density and UDIM tiles."
msgstr "读取模型已携带的 UV 贴图中的接缝线，并沿这些接缝进行展开，使碎片落在原有布局的位置上，同时保持我们的纹理密度和 UDIM 贴图区域。"

msgid "Preserve Texel Density"
msgstr "保留纹理密度"

msgid "Repack moves and turns the islands but leaves every one the size it is, so islands you scaled by hand keep their scale. Off, they all come out at one density."
msgstr "重新打包会移动和旋转岛屿，但不会改变每个岛屿的大小，因此手动缩放过的岛屿仍保持其原始比例。否则，所有岛屿都会以统一的密度输出。"

msgid "Final pack"
msgstr "最终打包"

msgid "When the unwrap has finished, the whole layout goes to Blender's own packer once more, every selected object together. It settles the islands the build left sitting on each other, so there is no need to go to UV > Pack Islands by hand afterwards. Every island stays in the UDIM tile it belongs to, and the whole selection comes out at one texel density."
msgstr "当展开完成后，整个布局会再次交由 Blender 自带的打包器处理，所有选中的对象一起。它会整理由构建留下的重叠岛屿，因此无需再手动执行 UV > Pack Islands。每个岛屿仍保留在其所属的 UDIM 瓦片中，整体输出保持统一的纹理密度。"

msgid "Every island the same texel size"
msgstr "所有岛屿相同的纹理尺寸"

msgid "Before packing, every island is put at the same texel density, so a checker comes out the same size all over the model. The packer then scales the whole layout by a single factor, which keeps them even - what it changes is the size of the layout, not one island against another."
msgstr "在打包前，将所有岛屿设置为相同的纹理密度，使模型各处生成的棋盘格图案大小一致。打包器随后对整个布局按单一比例因子进行缩放，从而保持各部分均衡——它改变的是布局的整体尺寸，而非单个岛屿之间的相对关系。"

msgid "Keep Stacked"
msgstr "保留堆叠"

msgid "Islands sitting exactly on one another were put there on purpose - a mirrored half, a part copied fifty times - and Pack Again keeps them together so they go on sharing one piece of texture. Turn it off to give every island its own place."
msgstr "完全重叠放置的岛屿是有意为之（例如镜像的一半、复制了五十次的部分），Pack Again 会保持它们在一起，使它们共享同一块纹理。关闭此选项可为每个岛屿分配独立的空间。"

msgid "Relax UVs"
msgstr "松弛 UV"

msgid "Evens out a layout that came out crumpled, without moving the cuts. Run it on a finished unwrap, not instead of one."
msgstr "用于修复因挤压而扭曲的布局，且不会移动切线。应在展开完成后运行，而非替代展开操作。"

msgid "Image size"
msgstr "图像尺寸"

msgid "How big the baked image is, in pixels each way. Bigger holds more detail and takes longer."
msgstr "烘焙图像的每个方向的像素大小。更大的尺寸包含更多细节，但耗时更长。"

msgid "Face count"
msgstr "面数"

msgid "How many quads the result is built from. More of them follow the shape closer and cost more to carry."
msgstr "结果由多少个四边形构成。更多的四边形会更贴合形状，但代价更高。"

msgid "Edge length"
msgstr "边长"

msgid "How long one quad's side should be. Smaller means a denser grid, whatever the model's size."
msgstr "单个四边形的边长应多长。较小的值意味着更密集的网格，无论模型大小如何。"

msgid "Sharp angle"
msgstr "锐角"

msgid "A fold steeper than this counts as an edge of the form and is kept. Softer than this is smoothed over."
msgstr "比此更陡的折叠被视为形式的边缘并被保留。比这更软的会被平滑处理。"

msgid "Remesh separately"
msgstr "分别重新网格化"

msgid "The model is opened out into its UV islands, and each island is remeshed on its own."
msgstr "模型被展开为独立的 UV 岛屿，每个岛屿都独立重新布线。"

msgid "Meet distance"
msgstr "距离"

msgid "How far apart two panels' border points may be and still be pulled onto each other."
msgstr "两个面板的边框点之间可以相距多远仍然会被吸附到一起。"

msgid "Weld panels"
msgstr "焊接面板"

msgid "The points that met are made into one, so the seam becomes a single line rather than two lying on each other."
msgstr "连接的点被合并为一个，因此接缝变成一条线而不是两条重叠的线。"

msgid "Close tears"
msgstr "修复撕裂"

msgid "Holes smaller than the model's own openings are filled, so a torn simulation does not stay torn."
msgstr "小于模型自身开口的孔洞会被填充，因此撕裂的模拟不会保持撕裂状态。"

msgid "Merge shells"
msgstr "合并壳层"

msgid "Pieces lying on top of each other are welded first, so the remesh sees one surface instead of two."
msgstr "重叠在一起的部件先被焊接，这样重网格化看到的是单一表面而不是两个。"

msgid "Pick a piece"
msgstr "选择部件"

msgid "Move over the model and the piece under the pointer lights up. Click and that piece is taken out on its own."
msgstr "将鼠标移动到模型上时，指针下方的部件会高亮显示。点击该部件即可单独选中它。"

msgid "Isolate piece"
msgstr "隔离部件"

msgid "Puts everything but the selected piece away, and pressing it again brings the rest back."
msgstr "除选中的部件外将所有其他部件隐藏，再次按下可恢复其余部分。"

msgid "Relax brush"
msgstr "放松笔刷"

msgid "A brush to drag over the surface. Wherever it passes, crumpled mesh is smoothed out and evened up."
msgstr "一个在表面拖动的笔刷。它经过的地方，褶皱网格会被平滑并拉平."

msgid "Join Into One"
msgstr "合并为一个"

msgid "Takes the seams out between the islands you have picked and flattens them as a single piece - the other way round from unwrapping them again, for when the cutting went too far and a part came out in more pieces than it needed. It does not cut anything new. The result lands where the old islands were, at the same texel density, and if it no longer fits there, Pack Again is the next button."
msgstr "将您选择的岛屿之间的接缝移除，并将其作为一个整体进行扁平化——这与再次展开它们的方向相反，适用于切割过度导致某部分被分成多余片数的情况。它不会创建新的切割。结果会落在旧岛屿所在的位置，具有相同的纹理密度；如果不再适合该位置，则点击“重新打包”按钮."

msgid "Which engine opens the picked islands again. Organic reads the shape and cuts where it stretches least, which suits bodies, curved panels and sculpts. Hard Surface projects along the piece's own lines, which is faster and suits flat panels, tubes and machined parts. The rest of the sheet is left exactly as it is either way."
msgstr "哪个引擎打开所选的岛屿。有机引擎读取形状并在拉伸最少的地方进行切割，这适用于身体、曲面面板和雕刻。硬表面引擎沿着物体自身的线条进行投影，速度更快，适用于扁平面板、管状结构和机加工零件。其余部分无论哪种方式都会保持原样."

msgid "Join Islands"
msgstr "合并岛屿"

msgid "Pick Islands On Model"
msgstr "在模型上选择岛屿"

msgid "Click the islands on the model itself - each one lights up in its own colour, and the ones you pick go the same colour together. Enter unwraps just those again at the Seams setting above and leaves the rest of the sheet alone; Esc changes nothing. Easier than hunting for the island in the UV editor."
msgstr "直接在模型上点击岛屿——每个岛屿会以自己的颜色高亮显示，您选择的岛屿会呈现相同的颜色。然后在上面的“接缝”设置中再次展开这些岛屿，其余部分保持不变；按 Esc 则没有任何变化。这比在 UV 编辑器中寻找岛屿要容易得多."

msgid "Garment Seams"
msgstr "服装接缝"

msgid "For a clean quad garment. Cuts it the way an artist does: rings round the cuffs, armholes, neck and bands, and straight lines along the edge flow - under the arm, down the sides, the center and inside of trouser legs, the waist of a dress - then unwraps and packs, UDIM tiles included. Shirts, hoodies, trousers, dresses and skirts; anything it does not recognise gets simple cuts."
msgstr "为干净的四边体服装。像艺术家那样裁剪：在袖口、腋下、领口和腰带处环绕，沿边缘的直线流畅延伸——穿过腋下、沿着两侧、裤腿的中心和内侧、裙子的腰部——然后展开并打包（包含 UDIM 贴图）。衬衫、连帽衫、裤子、连衣裙和裙子；任何它无法识别的物品都会得到简单的裁剪。"

msgid "Redo Selected Island"
msgstr "重做选中岛屿"

msgid "Unwraps the piece you have selected again, at the Seams setting above, and leaves every other island exactly where it is. Select the island in the UV editor or its faces in Edit Mode. It comes back at the same texel density as the rest and in the same place, in the same UDIM tile - if it no longer fits there, Pack Again is the next button."
msgstr "再次按上述接缝设置展开所选的部件，并将其他所有岛屿保持在原处。在 UV 编辑器中选择该岛屿或在编辑模式下选择其面。它将以与其余部分相同的 texel 密度和位置返回，位于相同的 UDIM 瓦片中——如果它不再适合那里，则“重新打包”是下一个按钮。"

msgid "From Reference Model"
msgstr "从参考模型"

msgid "Takes the texture off another model and puts it on this one, through the new UV. Select the model that has the texture first, then the unwrapped one last, so the unwrapped one is the active object - that is the one that gets the image."
msgstr "从另一个模型中获取纹理，并通过新的 UV 将其应用到当前模型上。首先选择带有纹理的模型，然后选择未展开的模型（即活动对象），这样未展开的模型就会接收该图像。"

msgid "Bake on GPU"
msgstr "GPU 烘焙"

msgid "Bakes on the graphics card where there is one set up in Preferences > System, and on the processor where there is not. It says which one it used while it runs."
msgstr "在图形卡上烘焙，如果已在“首选项”> “系统”中设置了；否则则在处理器上进行。它会在运行时显示使用的是哪一个。"

msgid "How many rays each pixel is worked out from. Colour and Normal need very few; Combined needs more, because the lighting is what is noisy."
msgstr "每个像素计算的光线数量。颜色和法线需要的很少；组合需要更多，因为光照是产生噪声的来源。"

msgid "How many pixels the bake paints past the edge of each island, so nothing shows a seam when the texture is filtered down."
msgstr "每个岛屿边缘外烘焙画笔的像素数，这样纹理下采样时就不会出现接缝。"

msgid "Bake into existing UV"
msgstr "烘焙到现有的 UV 映射"

msgid "The remesh is laid onto the UV the model already has, so the islands land where the old ones were."
msgstr "重网格会映射到模型已有的 UV 上，因此岛屿将落在旧位置。"

msgid "Show UV seams"
msgstr "显示 UV 接缝"

msgid "The flat layout folds back into the model, and the edges it was cut along light up. Those are the seams."
msgstr "平铺布局折叠回模型，沿其切割的边缘会发光。那些就是接缝。"

msgid "Seams as sharp"
msgstr "接缝为锐利边缘"

msgid "The UV cuts are also marked as hard edges, so the shading breaks where the pieces do."
msgstr "UV 切割也被标记为硬边，因此着色会在碎片处中断。"

msgid "Bake from original"
msgstr "从原始烘焙"

msgid "Carries the original's surface - its colour and its maps - onto the remesh, through the new UV."
msgstr "将原始的表面（包括颜色和贴图）通过新的 UV 烘焙到重新网格化后的模型上。"

msgid "Takes the baked surface back off and puts the materials and the UV the model had before it back, and deletes the images the bake wrote."
msgstr "将烘焙过的表面移除，并将模型在烘焙前的材质和 UV 恢复回去，同时删除烘焙写入的图像。"

msgid "Bake PBR"
msgstr "PBR 烘焙"

msgid "Bakes the whole set of maps rather than colour alone: roughness, metal, normal, whatever the material carries."
msgstr "不仅烘焙颜色，而是烘焙整套贴图（粗糙度、金属度、法线等），即材质所携带的所有信息。"

msgid "Runs the bake on the graphics card. Much faster where the card can take it, and falls back on its own where it cannot."
msgstr "在显卡上运行烘焙。如果显卡能够处理，则使用显卡；否则回退到自身处理。"

msgid "Pure quads"
msgstr "纯四边形面片"

msgid "Leaves no triangle anywhere. Off, the remesh puts a triangle in wherever quads alone will not close, which is tidier flow but not an all-quad mesh."
msgstr "没有任何三角形。关闭后，重新网格化会在四边形无法闭合的地方放置一个三角形，这样更整洁，但不是全四边形的网格。"

msgid "Reprojection steps"
msgstr "重投影步骤"

msgid "The remesh builds an even lattice first and then pulls it back onto the original surface. Each step drags it closer: too few and the result floats over the detail, too many and the flow smooths out. Two is a good place to sit."
msgstr "重网格化首先构建一个均匀的网格，然后将其拉回原始表面。每一步都会将其拉近：太少会导致结果浮于细节之上，太多则会使流动变得平滑。两个步骤是一个合适的选择。"

msgid "Card colour"
msgstr "卡片颜色"

msgid "The top strip picks the hue, the one under it how strong it is - slide it to the left and the card goes grey. The choice is kept in the add-on, so it stays across files."
msgstr "顶部条选择色相，其下方的条表示饱和度——向左滑动会使卡片变灰。该设置保存在插件中，因此会跨文件保持。"

msgid "Corner rounding"
msgstr "圆角"

msgid "How round every corner on the card is. All the way down is square, all the way up is a pill."
msgstr "卡片每个角落的圆角程度。最下面是方形，最上面是胶囊形。"

msgid "Builds the model again on an even quad mesh, at the size you asked for, keeping the shape it already had."
msgstr "在偶数四边形网格上重新构建模型，保持其原有形状，并为您指定的尺寸。"

msgid "Remesh hardsurface"
msgstr "重新网格硬表面"

msgid "Reads the model's own hard edges and lays the new quads along them, so panels stay panels and corners stay corners."
msgstr "读取模型的自身硬边，并将新的四边形沿其排列，因此面板保持为面板，角点保持为角点。"

msgid "Detect crease angle"
msgstr "检测折角角度"

msgid "Finds the angle at which this model's edges actually turn, and treats anything sharper than that as an edge to keep. Off, you set the angle yourself."
msgstr "找出该模型边缘实际转折的角度，并将其视为需要保留的边缘。关闭时，您自行设置角度。"

msgid "Calibrate face count"
msgstr "校准面数"

msgid "The engine rarely lands on the count first time. This measures what came out and runs it again aimed at your number, so the result is the count you asked for."
msgstr "引擎通常不会第一次就得到正确的数量。此功能测量结果并再次运行以匹配您的目标数量，因此结果是您所请求的数量。"

msgid "Search settings"
msgstr "搜索设置"

msgid "Tries the remesh at several settings and keeps whichever came out best, instead of taking the first result. Slower, and usually cleaner."
msgstr "尝试多种重新网格化设置并保留效果最佳的结果，而不是仅采用第一个结果。速度较慢，但通常更干净。"

msgid "Automatic thresholds"
msgstr "自动阈值"

msgid "Works the crease and coplanar numbers out from the model itself. Turn it off to dial them in by hand."
msgstr "从模型本身计算折痕和共面数值。关闭它以便手动调整这些值。"

msgid "Weld close lines"
msgstr "焊接近线"

msgid "Two lines running almost on top of each other are one line the model found twice. Anything closer together than this is merged into a single line."
msgstr "两条几乎重合的线是模型重复发现的一条。比这更近的距离会被合并成一条线。"

msgid "Remove straight loops"
msgstr "移除直线环"

msgid "A loop crossing flat ground carries no shape and only costs faces. Loops flatter than this are dissolved."
msgstr "穿过平坦地面的环没有形状，只会增加面数。比这个更平的环会被溶解。"

msgid "Min length"
msgstr "最小长度"

msgid "Short stubs of line are noise, not features. Anything shorter than this is dropped before the mesh is built."
msgstr "短线段只是噪声而非特征。比这个更短的线段在构建网格前就会被丢弃。"

msgid "Keep circles round"
msgstr "保持圆形"

msgid "A hole read off the mesh comes back as a polygon. This puts it back on a true circle so the ring stays round."
msgstr "从网格读取的孔会返回为一个多边形。这使其恢复为真正的圆形，从而保持环的形状。"

msgid "Flat and curved boundaries"
msgstr "平坦和弯曲边界"

msgid "Tells a straight border from a curved one and holds each to its own shape, instead of fitting one rule to both."
msgstr "区分直线边界和曲线边界，并将它们各自保持在自己的形状中，而不是用一条规则同时拟合两者。"

msgid "Close gaps"
msgstr "闭合缝隙"

msgid "A line that stops short of the one facing it leaves a hole. This carries it across and closes it."
msgstr "一条未延伸到对面线条的线会留下缺口。这会将它跨越并闭合该缺口。"

msgid "Gap reach"
msgstr "间隙范围"

msgid "How far a line is allowed to reach to find the one facing it. Too far and lines meet that were never meant to."
msgstr "允许线条延伸以找到其对应面的距离。太远会导致本不该相交的线条相交。"

msgid "Fill Missed Gaps"
msgstr "填充缺失的间隙"

msgid "Finds the openings left in the retopology and closes them, carrying the lines across so the new faces fit the ones already there."
msgstr "查找拓扑中留下的开口并将其闭合，使线条跨越，让新面与已存在的面吻合。"

msgid "Mirror retopology"
msgstr "镜像拓扑"

msgid "Retopologises one side and takes the other side from it, so the two halves match exactly."
msgstr "对一侧进行重拓扑，并从另一侧复制，使两半完全匹配。"

msgid "Include my lines"
msgstr "包含我的行"

msgid "Counts the edges you marked by hand along with the ones the model found on its own."
msgstr "将您手动标记的边与模型自行找到的边一同计数。"

msgid "Only my lines"
msgstr "仅我的线条"

msgid "Ignores everything the model found and works from the edges you marked, and nothing else."
msgstr "忽略模型中发现的所有内容，仅从您标记的边缘开始工作，且不会处理其他部分。"

msgid "How much of the knotted area is taken out and laid again as plain rows. Higher clears more of it."
msgstr "清除多少打结区域并将其重新平铺为普通行。数值越高，清除的范围越大。"

msgid "Takes the knotted area out and lays it again as plain rows of quads."
msgstr "将打结区域移除并重新平铺为四边形的普通行。"

msgid "Stay inside lines"
msgstr "保留内部线条"

msgid "The tidying stops at the lines you marked and does not run out into the rest of the model."
msgstr "整理工作会在您标记的线条处停止，不会延伸到模型的其余部分。"

msgid "Flat below"
msgstr "下方平整"

msgid "A loop crossing flat ground holds no shape. Loops flatter than this are the ones offered up for removal."
msgstr "穿过平坦地面的环没有形状。比这更扁平的环是可供移除的对象。"

msgid "Remove per kept"
msgstr "每保留一个移除一个"

msgid "Out of every few loops, one is kept. Thins an over-dense area evenly instead of clearing it."
msgstr "每隔几个环保留一个。均匀地变薄过度密集的区域，而不是完全清除它。"

msgid "Use this mesh"
msgstr "使用此网格"

msgid "Works from what is on screen. With Replace original on, the add-on keeps reading the mesh the result was built from, and a piece pulled out of a result carries that link with it - so remeshing the piece would rebuild the whole model instead. This breaks the link."
msgstr "基于屏幕上显示的内容。启用“替换原始”后，插件会持续读取构建结果所基于的网格，"

msgid "Build subdiv cage"
msgstr "构建细分笼"

msgid "Builds a small all-quad cage over the model, sits it on the surface, finds the model's own hard edges and creases them into the cage, then puts a Subdivision Surface on top. The same three things a box-modelled cage does, without the hour of knife work."
msgstr "这会破坏链接.|||~|||构建细分笼|||在模型上方构建一个小全四边形笼，将其放置在表面，"

msgid "Cage faces"
msgstr "笼子面"

msgid "How many faces the cage is built with. Hand made cages sit between a few hundred and a thousand: enough to hold the form, few enough to move by hand afterwards."
msgstr "笼子由多少个面构成。手工制作的笼子介于几百到一千个面之间：数量足以支撑形状，又少得可以在完成后用手移动。"

msgid "Crease over"
msgstr "折痕"

msgid "A fold in the model sharper than this is creased into the cage, so subdivision keeps it sharp instead of rounding it off. This is what support loops do by hand."
msgstr "模型上比这个更尖锐的折痕会被压入笼子中，因此细分会保持其尖锐而不是将其圆滑化。这就是支持环手动操作所做的事情。"

msgid "Back to original"
msgstr "返回原始"

msgid "Takes off everything the add-on put on this model - lines, cleanups, chamfers - and leaves what you started with."
msgstr "移除附加程序在此模型上添加的所有内容——线条、清理和倒角——并留下您最初的内容。"

msgid "Merge distance"
msgstr "合并距离"

msgid "Points closer together than this are made into one, so a seam that should be shut is shut."
msgstr "比这个更近的点会被合并，因此本应闭合的接缝会被关闭。"

msgid "Meet panel vertices"
msgstr "连接面板顶点"

msgid "Walks the panel borders and brings the vertices facing each other onto the same point, so the panels meet cleanly."
msgstr "沿着面板边缘行走，将彼此相邻的面板顶点汇聚到同一点，使面板能够干净地拼接在一起。"

msgid "Keeps the result and carries on with it as the model, so the next thing you do works on the new mesh."
msgstr "保留结果并继续作为模型进行操作，因此您接下来的操作将在新的网格上生效。"

msgid "Puts the model you started with back and sets the remesh aside."
msgstr "恢复原始模型并将重新网格化设置置为待处理状态。"

msgid "Rebuild flat areas"
msgstr "重建平坦区域"

msgid "Finds the areas that are flat and takes each one out as a single face, so the fans and diagonals across them go, along with the points sitting on those diagonals. Those points hold three edges each, which is why At least 3 edges never touches them."
msgstr "查找平坦的区域，将每个区域单独提取为一个面，这样穿过它们的扇形和对角线也会被移除，以及位于这些对角线上的点。每个点拥有三条边，这就是为什么“至少 3 条边”永远不会接触到它们的原因。"

msgid "Keep my lines"
msgstr "保留我的线条"

msgid "Rebuild flat areas never dissolves across an edge you marked Sharp, marked as a seam, or selected. Without it a line drawn on a flat panel goes with the fan around it."
msgstr "重建平坦区域不会溶解您标记为 Sharp、接缝或已选择的边缘。没有它，在平面上绘制的线条会跟随其周围的扇形移动。"

msgid "At least 3 edges"
msgstr "至少 3 条边"

msgid "Clears out every vertex holding fewer than three edges: loose points and spurs are deleted, and a point sitting between just two edges is dissolved into one line."
msgstr "清除所有少于三条边的顶点：删除孤点和突起，并将仅由两条边构成的点溶解为一条线。"

msgid "Hardsurface - Tutorial"
msgstr "硬表面建模 - 教程"

msgid "Opens the walkthrough for remeshing a hard surface model on YouTube: the lines it reads, the panels it builds, and the cleanup that follows."
msgstr "在 YouTube 上打开硬表面模型重新网格化的演示视频：它讲解的文本、构建的面板以及随后的清理工作。"

msgid "Cloth Remeshing - Tutorial"
msgstr "布料重网格化 - 教程"

msgid "Opens the walkthrough for remeshing a garment on YouTube: the panels, the seams, and which settings matter."
msgstr "在 YouTube 上打开布料重网格化的演示视频：面板、接缝以及哪些设置很重要。"

msgid "Auto Unwrap - Tutorials"
msgstr "自动展开 UV - 教程"

msgid "Opens the Auto Unwrap walkthrough on YouTube in your browser."
msgstr "在浏览器中打开自动展开 UV 的演示视频。"

msgid "Texel Density - Tutorial"
msgstr "纹理密度 - 教程"

msgid "Opens the lesson on texel density on YouTube: why every part should get the same amount of texture, and how the parts and the layout keep it even."
msgstr "在 YouTube 上打开关于纹理密度的课程：为什么每个部分都应该获得相同数量的纹理，以及各个部分和布局如何保持均匀分布。"

msgid "Symmetry - Tutorial"
msgstr "对称性 - 教程"

msgid "Opens the lesson on symmetry on YouTube: how a model that mirrors is cut the same on both sides, where the seam down the middle belongs, and what the two halves do on the sheet."
msgstr "打开 YouTube 上的对称性课程：镜像模型在两侧如何切割，中线接缝归属何处，以及两个半部分如何在平面上展开。"

msgid "Stack Repeats - Tutorial"
msgstr "重复堆叠 - 教程"

msgid "Opens the lesson on repeated parts on YouTube: why a part modelled once and copied fifty times should take one place on the sheet, and what that costs you in return."
msgstr "打开 YouTube 上的重复部件课程：为什么一个建模一次并复制五十次的部件应只占一张板料中的一个位置，以及这为您节省了什么代价。"

msgid "UDIMs - Tutorial"
msgstr "UDIMs - 教程"

msgid "Opens the lesson on UDIMs on YouTube: what the tiles are, when a model needs more than one, and how parts are spread over them."
msgstr "打开 YouTube 上的 UDIMs 课程：什么是贴图瓦片，何时需要超过一个瓦片，以及部件如何在多个瓦片上分布。"

msgid "Classic panel"
msgstr "经典面板"

msgid "Swaps this card for the side panel the add-on shipped with. The way back is the first button at the top of that panel. The choice is kept in the add-on."
msgstr "将此卡片替换为随插件附带的侧边栏。返回该面板的方法是点击其顶部的第一个按钮。选择将保存在插件中。"

msgid "Replace original"
msgstr "替换原始模型"

