msgid "Discord - Support"
msgstr "Discord - 支持"

msgid "%d split objects"
msgstr "%d 个拆分对象"

msgid "Preview of %d parts"
msgstr "%d 部分的预览"

msgid "Runs before splitting"
msgstr "在拆分之前运行"

msgid "Analyze or split a model first"
msgstr "先分析或拆分模型"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Return"
msgstr "返回"

msgid "the model is not symmetric"
msgstr "模型不是对称的"

msgid "faces do not mirror"
msgstr "面没有镜像"

msgid "%d islands mirrored in themselves, %d twin islands copied"
msgstr "%d 个岛屿自身镜像，%d 对孪生岛屿复制"

msgid "%d objects, %d islands"
msgstr "%d 个对象，%d 个岛屿"

msgid "Automatic UV unwrapping with the OptCuts engine, split by Smart Segmentation parts, cleaned for AI generated meshes"
msgstr "使用 OptCuts 引擎进行自动 UV 展开，按智能分割部分拆分，为 AI 生成的网格进行清理"

msgid "Texel Density in UV Mapping"
msgstr "UV 映射中的纹理密度"

msgid "What's UDIMs in UV Mapping?"
msgstr "什么是 UDIMs 在 UV 映射中？"

msgid "Symmetry in UV Mapping"
msgstr "UV 映射中的对称性"

msgid "Stacking Repeated Parts"
msgstr "堆叠重复部件"

msgid "Smart Segmentation addon is not enabled"
msgstr "未启用智能分割插件"

msgid "Smart Segmentation analyze failed"
msgstr "智能分割分析失败"

msgid "Smart Segmentation produced no result for '%s'. Restart Blender and try again"
msgstr "智能分割针对'%s'未生成结果。请重启 Blender 并重新尝试"

msgid "Seam Allow"
msgstr "边缘允许"

msgid "Seam Avoid"
msgstr "边缘避让"

msgid "AutoUnwrap Checker"
msgstr "自动展开检查器"

msgid "AutoUnwrap Parts Preview"
msgstr "自动展开部件预览"

msgid "AutoUnwrap Distortion"
msgstr "自动展开失真度"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Show Distortion"
msgstr "显示失真度"

msgid "Colour the model by how much the layout pulls it out of shape - blue where the surface is clean, red where it is stretched. Click again to hide"
msgstr "根据布局将模型拉出形状的程度对模型进行着色 - 表面干净处为蓝色，拉伸处为红色。再次点击以隐藏"

msgid "This model has no '%s' layout to read"
msgstr "此模型没有'%s'布局可供读取"

msgid "Select some faces first"
msgstr "先选择一些面"

msgid "Select some faces first (Edit Mode, face select)"
msgstr "先选择一些面（编辑模式，面选择）"

msgid "%d parts"
msgstr "%d 个部分"

msgid ", and %d lying flat against it laid along the next axis instead"
msgstr "，并且有 %d 个平躺在其上并沿下一个轴放置"

msgid "Smart Segmentation produced no result. Restart Blender and try again"
msgstr "智能分割未产生结果。重启 Blender 并重试"

msgid "no island crosses the mirror plane"
msgstr "没有岛屿跨越镜像平面"

msgid "%d island(s) unwrapped on one half and mirrored"
msgstr "%d 个岛屿在半个上展开并镜像"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Auto Unwrap"
msgstr "自动展开"

msgid "Unwrap the active mesh with OptCuts. Esc cancels"
msgstr "使用 OptCuts 引擎为当前系统展开活动网格。Esc 取消"

msgid "OptCuts engine for this system is missing from the addon"
msgstr "此系统的 OptCuts 引擎未在插件中提供"

msgid "%d%% of this mesh is torn - use Smart UV (Hardsurface)"
msgstr "%d%% 的该网格被撕裂了——请使用智能 UV（硬表面）"

msgid "no window to put it in"
msgstr "没有放置它的窗口"

msgid "%d%% of this mesh sits on edges shared by"
msgstr "%d%% 的该网格位于由以下边共享的位置："

msgid "three or more faces. This engine cannot"
msgstr "三个或更多面。此引擎无法处理。"

msgid "flatten geometry like that."
msgstr "像这样展平几何体。"

msgid "Use Smart UV (Hardsurface) instead, or"
msgstr "改用智能 UV（硬表面）模式，或"

msgid "clean the mesh first: Merge by Distance,"
msgstr "先清理网格：按距离合并，"

msgid "then Select > All by Trait > Non Manifold."
msgstr "然后选择 > 按属性全部选择 > 非流形。"

msgid "Auto Unwrap: torn mesh"
msgstr "自动展开：撕裂的网格"

msgid "Nothing to unwrap"
msgstr "未解开的包裹"

msgid "Auto Unwrap cancelled"
msgstr "取消自动解算"

msgid "Auto Unwrap failed: %s"
msgstr "自动展开失败：%s"

msgid "picked islands redone with the organic engine: %d"
msgstr "使用有机引擎重新生成所选岛屿：%d"

msgid "Auto Unwrap: {msg}"
msgstr "自动展开：{msg}"

msgid "Run Auto Unwrap from the panel"
msgstr "从面板运行自动展开"

msgid "the mesh changed while unwrapping"
msgstr "在展开过程中网格发生了变化"

msgid ", plus %d cuts a part needed to be laid out at all"
msgstr "，加上 %d 个切割部分需要全部展开"

msgid "%s: %d islands, %.0fs"
msgstr "%s: %d 个岛屿，%.0fs"

msgid "Parts From"
msgstr "来自部分"

msgid "Seams never cross a Smart Segmentation part"
msgstr "智能分割部分永远不会跨越接缝"

msgid "How many parts Smart Segmentation splits the model into. Seams never cross a part, so this places the borders the cutting cannot find on its own. A hard surface model has its own borders and 8-30 is plenty; a figure does not - over fifteen figures 400 beat 8 on every measure and took no longer, while on a motorcycle the same 400 was worse. 1 keeps the model whole (a head, a single organic shape)"
msgstr "智能分割将模型划分为多少个部分。接缝永远不会跨越一个部分，因此这会将切割无法自行找到的边界放置到位。硬表面模型有自己的边界，8-30 就足够了；人物则没有——超过十五个人物时，400 在每一项上都优于 8，而且耗时并不更长，而在摩托车上同样的 400 效果更差。1 保持模型的完整性（一个头部、单个有机形状）"

msgid "Priority"
msgstr "优先级"

msgid "More seams, less distortion"
msgstr "更多接缝，更少扭曲"

msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "平衡"

msgid "Fewer islands, more distortion"
msgstr "较少岛屿，更多扭曲"

msgid "Parallel Pieces"
msgstr "平行切片"

msgid "How many pieces OptCuts solves at the same time. 0 = Auto, one per CPU core"
msgstr "同时解决多少段切割。0 = 自动，每个 CPU 核心一段"

msgid "Fast Mode"
msgstr "快速模式"

msgid "Cut big pieces at creases into smaller chunks that solve side by side. Much faster on models with few parts, adds a few islands"
msgstr "在折痕处将大块切割成更小的块，使它们能够并排拼接。对于部件较少的模型，速度更快，可增加一些孤岛。"

msgid "Chunk Size"
msgstr "切片大小"

msgid "Pieces with more triangles than this are cut into chunks of about this size. Smaller is faster, larger gives fewer islands"
msgstr "比此三角形数量更多的部件会被切割成大约这个大小的块。更小更快，更大则岛屿更少"

msgid "Engine"
msgstr "引擎"

msgid "Which engine unwraps the islands picked on the model"
msgstr "选择用于在模型上展开所选岛屿的引擎"

msgid "Organic"
msgstr "有机"

msgid "Unwrap the picked islands with the organic engine (OptCuts). Slower, and the right choice on curved, continuous shapes: bodies, panels, sculpts"
msgstr "使用有机引擎（OptCuts）展开所选岛屿。较慢，但适用于曲线、连续形状：身体、面板、雕塑等"

msgid "Unwrap the picked islands with the hard surface engine. Fast, and the right choice on flat panels, tubes and machined parts"
msgstr "使用硬表面引擎展开所选岛屿。快速，且适用于平坦面板、管道和加工零件等"

msgid "Seams"
msgstr "接缝"

msgid "Artist Seams"
msgstr "艺术家接缝"

msgid "Cut parts free at their roots, open each part with one hidden cut along loops and the symmetry line, add cuts only where it stretches"
msgstr "在部件根部处切割分离，沿环线和对称线各开一条隐藏切口，仅在拉伸处添加切口"

msgid "OptCuts Search"
msgstr "OptCuts 搜索"

msgid "Let OptCuts search for the seams"
msgstr "让 OptCuts 搜索接缝"

msgid "Clean Seams"
msgstr "清理接缝"

msgid "Straighten seams along edge loops and move them to less visible places after OptCuts. Kept only when stretch stays low"
msgstr "沿边缘环拉直接缝，并在 OptCuts 后将其移至更不显眼的地方。仅在拉伸保持较低时保留"

msgid "Min Piece Triangles"
msgstr "最小三角形数量"

msgid "Smaller loose bits join a neighbouring island instead of getting their own"
msgstr "较小的碎片会连接到邻近的岛屿，而不是形成自己的岛屿。"

msgid "UDIM Tiles"
msgstr "UDIM 瓦片"

msgid "How many UDIM tiles the layout is spread over. 1 is the ordinary single 0-1 square. Above that the parts are dealt out by area - 1001, 1002, 1003 - so every tile carries about the same amount of surface and the texel density stays even across them"
msgstr "布局跨越了多少个 UDIM 瓦片。1 是普通的单个 0-1 正方形。在此基础上，部分按面积分配——1001、1002、1003——因此每个瓦片承载的表面量大致相同，且纹理密度在这些瓦片之间保持一致。"

msgid "Optimize Layout"
msgstr "优化布局"

msgid "Work on the layout after the flattening: straighten the panels onto their own grid, break a sheet into the panels it is made of, and cut an island that runs the length of the square. It fills the sheet and pays for itself on models built out of even quad panels. Turn it off when it misreads a model and cuts up a flattening that was already right: what comes out of the flattening is then packed as it is"
msgstr "在展平后处理布局：将面板调整到各自的网格中，将一个面片拆分为它由的面板组成，并切割一条贯穿正方形的岛屿。它在由偶数四边形面板构建的模型上填充整个面片，并且自身就能盈利。当展平器误读模型并将原本正确的展平结果切分时，请关闭此功能：此时从展平器输出的内容将保持原样"

msgid "Prefer"
msgstr "优先"

msgid "What to give up when cutting less and stretching less pull against each other"
msgstr "当减少切割和拉伸时，它们会相互拉扯。放弃什么？"

msgid "Fewer Pieces"
msgstr "更少部件"

msgid "Cut less and leave larger islands, even where that means a little more stretch. A layout somebody has to work in by hand"
msgstr "切少一些，留下更大的岛屿，即使这意味着需要稍微拉伸。这是一种必须由手工完成的工作布局。"

msgid "The default: cut again wherever the flattening went wrong, but not past the point where it pays"
msgstr "默认：在扁平化出错的地方再次切割，但不超过开始付费的点。"

msgid "Cut wherever it helps the shapes, whatever that costs in extra islands. For a bake, where nobody reads the layout"
msgstr "在有助于形状的地方进行切割，无论这会增加多少额外的岛屿。对于烘焙（bake），没人会去阅读布局的。"

msgid "Final Pack"
msgstr "最终包"

msgid "When the unwrap has finished, hand the whole layout to Blender's own packer once more, every tile taken as a whole and every selected object together. It settles the islands the build left sitting on each other, keeps every island in the UDIM tile it belongs to, and leaves the whole selection at one texel density. Nothing is flattened again and nothing leaves its tile"
msgstr "当展开完成时，再次将整个布局交给 Blender 自己的打包器处理，每个瓦片作为一个整体、每个选中的对象作为一个整体进行处理。它会将构建留下的岛屿彼此靠拢，确保每个岛屿都保留在其所属的 UDIM 瓦片中，并将整个选择保持在统一的纹理密度下。不会再次进行扁平化操作，也不会让任何物体离开其所在的瓦片。"

msgid "Even Density First"
msgstr "密度优先"

msgid "Before packing, put every island at the same texel density, so the checker comes out the same size all over the model. The packer then scales the whole layout by one factor, which keeps them even"
msgstr "在打包之前，将所有岛屿设置为相同的纹理密度，这样棋盘格在整个模型上会保持一致的大小。然后打包器将整体布局按一个比例缩放，从而保持均匀性"

msgid "Pack the islands again without touching their size. After the unwrap you may have scaled a few islands up or down by hand, to spend more texture on a face and less on the underside. With this on, Repack only moves and turns the islands, so those choices survive. With it off every island is brought to one texel density and the whole layout is packed to fill the tile"
msgstr "在不改变岛屿大小的情况下重新打包岛屿。解包后，你可能已经手动调整了几个岛屿的缩放比例，以便在某个面上使用更多纹理而在另一面使用更少。开启此选项时，Repack 只会移动和旋转岛屿，因此这些选择会被保留。关闭此选项时，每个岛屿都会被调整到相同的纹理密度，整个布局将被打包以填满瓦片"

msgid "Islands sitting exactly on top of each other were put there on purpose - a mirrored half, a part copied fifty times - so Pack Again keeps them together. Turn it off to give every island its own place"
msgstr "重叠在一起的岛屿是特意放置的——一个镜像的一半，复制了五十份——这样“再次打包”功能才能将它们保持在一起。关闭它可以让每座岛屿拥有自己的位置。"

msgid "Stack Repeats"
msgstr "堆叠重复"

msgid "Put repeated parts on top of each other. A tank's track links, a panel's hundred identical screws - they are the same part, so they get one place on the sheet and the texture spends its resolution once instead of fifty times. Off unless you ask for it: stacked copies cannot be painted apart afterwards, so it is a choice about the model rather than something to do to every model"
msgstr "将重复的部分重叠放置。坦克的履带连接件、面板上的一百个相同螺丝——它们是同一个部件，因此只需在一张图纸上绘制一次，纹理也只需消耗一次分辨率而非五十次。除非您要求，否则堆叠的副本无法之后再分别上色，所以这是建模时的一个选择，而不是对每个模型都要做的操作。"

msgid "Tiles By"
msgstr "按图块分类"

msgid "What decides which tile a piece lands on, when several objects are unwrapped together"
msgstr "当多个对象一起展开时，决定某个物体落在哪个瓷砖上的因素是什么？"

msgid "Object"
msgstr "对象"

msgid "An object is never split across tiles. With fewer tiles than objects they are dealt out largest first onto whichever tile is emptiest, so the tiles still fill up evenly. This is how a vehicle or a weapon is usually textured"
msgstr "一个对象永远不会被分割到多个瓦片上。当瓦片数量少于对象数量时，它们会按从大到小的顺序分配给最空的瓦片，因此瓦片仍然能均匀填充。这就是车辆或武器通常进行纹理贴图的方式。"

msgid "The islands themselves are dealt out, so every tile carries about the same amount of surface and the texel density is as even as it can be. An object may be spread over several tiles"
msgstr "岛屿本身是按比例分配的，因此每个图块所承载的表面面积大致相同，且纹理密度尽可能均匀。一个对象可能分布在多个图块上。"

msgid "Which projector Smart UV runs"
msgstr "Smart UV 支持的投影仪"

msgid "Cut along the model's own lines, as few as the shape allows, and keep mirrored parts together"
msgstr "沿模型的自身线条切割，尽可能少地切割，并将镜像部分保持在一起。"

msgid "Blender"
msgstr "Blender"

msgid "Blender's own Smart UV Project, run one part at a time"
msgstr "Blender 自带的智能 UV 展开，一次运行一个部分"

msgid "Piece Size"
msgstr "块大小"

msgid "How much curvature one island may swallow, in radians. Higher means fewer, larger islands and a little more stretch; lower means more islands that lie flatter"
msgstr "一个岛屿可能吞噬多少弧度。数值越高，岛屿越少、越大，拉伸也稍多一点；数值越低，岛屿越多且更扁平。"

msgid "Angle Limit"
msgstr "角度限制"

msgid "Blender's Smart UV Project angle limit, in degrees. Lower cuts more often and gives flatter islands"
msgstr "Blender 的 Smart UV Project 角度限制，单位为度。降低该值会更多地进行裁剪，并产生更扁平的岛屿。"

msgid "Island Margin"
msgstr "岛礁边缘"

msgid "The gap Smart UV Project leaves between its islands"
msgstr "Smart UV 项目留下的岛屿之间的间隙"

msgid "Area Weight"
msgstr "区域权重"

msgid "How much a face's size counts when Smart UV Project picks its projections"
msgstr "Smart UV Project 选择投影时，面的大小权重有多大？"

msgid "Correct Aspect"
msgstr "正确比例"

msgid "Take the image's aspect into account, so a non-square texture is not stretched"
msgstr "考虑图像的纵横比，因此非方形纹理不会被拉伸。"

msgid "Hide Seams in Creases"
msgstr "隐藏折痕处的接缝"

msgid "Push seams into grooves, inner corners and occluded gaps, away from open surfaces"
msgstr "将接缝推入凹槽、内角和被遮挡的缝隙中，远离开放表面"

msgid "Strength"
msgstr "强度"

msgid "How strongly seams avoid visible surfaces. Higher values take longer and can add islands. Paint vertex groups \"Seam Allow\" or \"Seam Avoid\" to guide it by hand"
msgstr "缝如何避免可见表面。较高的值需要更长时间，并可能产生孤岛。手动绘制顶点组“缝合允许”或“缝合避开”以引导其走向。"

msgid "Gap Size"
msgstr "间隙大小"

msgid "How far the occlusion test looks, as a share of the model size"
msgstr "遮挡测试看起来占模型大小的多少比例"

msgid "Rays"
msgstr "射线"

msgid "Occlusion rays per vertex. More is smoother and slower"
msgstr "每顶点的光线遮蔽数。更多更平滑但速度更慢"

msgid "UV Map"
msgstr "UV 贴图"

msgid "After the cutting, every seam is offered back: the two islands either side are joined, opened again together and measured, and the join is kept only when nothing got worse. This says how much shear you will trade for one seam fewer. Zero still joins, but only where the join costs nothing at all"
msgstr "切割后，每条接缝都会被重新连接：两侧的岛屿被合并、再次展开并测量，只有当接缝不会使情况变糟时才保留。这说明了为了减少一条接缝你愿意牺牲多少剪切变形。零仍然会连接，但只有在接缝完全不需要代价的地方才会连接"

msgid "Lay every island so that one direction in the world points up the sheet. Straightening squares an island on the grid but leaves four ways up equally square, which is fine until the texture has a grain to it - rain running down a panel, a drip of rust, the grain of a plank, brushed steel. With this on the packer is not allowed to turn islands, so the sheet fills a little less tightly"
msgstr "将所有岛屿放置为在世界空间中一个方向指向纸张上方。将正方形网格上的岛屿拉直，但这会留下四个方向同样呈方形，这在纹理具有颗粒感之前是可以接受的——雨水顺着面板流下、锈水滴落、木板的纹理、拉丝钢。有了这个设置，打包器不允许旋转岛屿，因此纸张填充得稍微不那么紧密"

msgid "Along"
msgstr "沿边"

msgid "Which way in the world points up the sheet"
msgstr "世界空间中哪个方向指向纸张上方"

msgid "Left to right"
msgstr "从左到右"

msgid "Front to back"
msgstr "从前到后"

msgid "Up, which is what rain runs down"
msgstr "向上，即雨水流下的方向"

msgid "Mark Seams"
msgstr "标记接缝"

msgid "Pack Islands"
msgstr "打包岛屿"

msgid "Margin"
msgstr "边距"

msgid "Symmetry"
msgstr "对称性"

msgid "On a symmetric model: parts, seams and the finished UVs are mirrored. A part the mirror plane runs through keeps ONE seam on the plane, it is never cut twice, and its island is made symmetric in itself"
msgstr "在对称模型中：部件、接缝和完成的 UV 贴图会镜像。如果镜面对穿过的部件，它会在平面上保留一条接缝，永远不会被切割两次，并且其岛屿本身也会呈对称状"

msgid "Which way the mirror plane faces. Auto looks for the plane the model itself is symmetric about, in any direction; naming the axis skips that search"
msgstr "镜像平面朝向哪个方向。Auto 会自动查找模型本身的对称面（任何方向）；命名轴会跳过此搜索"

msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "Find the plane from the model"
msgstr "从模型中查找平面"

msgid "Mirror left to right"
msgstr "从左到右镜像"

msgid "Mirror front to back"
msgstr "从前到后镜像"

msgid "Mirror top to bottom"
msgstr "从上到下镜像"

msgid "Offset"
msgstr "偏移"

msgid "Slide the plane off the middle of the model, as a share of its half width along that axis"
msgstr "将平面沿模型的中线滑动，作为该轴方向上其半宽的一部分"

msgid "Treat the part borders as cuts that must be kept. The unwrap still cuts inside a part where it has to, but it never joins two parts back together and never throws the segmentation away and starts again. Off, the parts are a starting point and the engine is free to rework them"
msgstr "将部分边界视为必须保留的切口。展开仍然会在需要时进行内部切割，但它永远不会将两个部分重新连接起来，也绝不会丢弃分段并重新开始。断开后，这些部分只是一个起点，引擎可以自由地对其进行重做"

msgid "Cut the model along the mirror plane before anything else, so the seam runs exactly down the middle and every other cut is placed against it. Off, the seam lands wherever the flattener finds it cheapest, which is often beside the middle rather than on it"
msgstr "在其它任何操作之前，沿镜像平面切割模型，这样接缝会正好位于中间，而所有其他切口都会紧贴着它。断开后，接缝会落在展开器认为最便宜的位置，这通常是在中线旁边而不是正在线上"

msgid "Draw the mirror plane on the model"
msgstr "在模型上绘制镜像平面"

msgid "Bake Size"
msgstr "烘焙尺寸"

msgid "Resolution of the baked texture"
msgstr "烘焙纹理的分辨率"

msgid "What to bake into the new UV layout"
msgstr "要烘焙到新 UV 布局中的内容"

msgid "Colour"
msgstr "颜色"

msgid "Base colour only, no lighting"
msgstr "仅基础颜色，无光照"

msgid "Combined"
msgstr "混合"

msgid "Colour with lighting"
msgstr "用光照着色"

msgid "Emission"
msgstr "自发光"

msgid "Emission only"
msgstr "仅自发光"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "法线"

msgid "Normal map"
msgstr "法线贴图"

msgid "Pixels painted past the island borders"
msgstr "超出岛屿边界的像素"

msgid "From Selected Object"
msgstr "从选定对象"

msgid "Bake from another selected object onto this one (select the original model first, then the unwrapped one last)"
msgstr "烘焙到另一个选定的对象（先选择原始模型，最后选择不展开的模型）"

msgid "Samples"
msgstr "采样数"

msgid "Render samples used while baking"
msgstr "烘焙时使用的渲染样本"

msgid "Let Cycles bake on the graphics card where it can. It falls back on the processor on its own when no card is set up in Preferences > System"
msgstr "在图形卡上烘焙 Cycles，如果未设置图形卡，则会自动使用处理器。请在“偏好设置”> “系统”中设置图形卡。"

msgid "Relax Iterations"
msgstr "放松迭代次数"

msgid "More iterations even out stretch further and take longer"
msgstr "更多迭代会进一步拉伸并花费更长时间"

msgid "Classic Panel"
msgstr "经典面板"

msgid "Use the plain sidebar panel instead of the viewport card"
msgstr "使用普通侧边栏面板而不是视口卡片"

msgid "Part Colours"
msgstr "部件颜色"

msgid "How strong the colours are on Show Parts and while picking. Turn it up when neighbouring parts are hard to tell apart"
msgstr "选择部件时，颜色有多鲜艳？当相邻部件难以区分时调高它。"

msgid "Accent Hue"
msgstr "色相"

msgid "Accent Saturation"
msgstr "饱和度"

msgid "Corner Rounding"
msgstr "圆角"

msgid "Card Brightness"
msgstr "卡片亮度"

msgid "How light the card and its boxes are painted. Screens and colour settings differ; turn it down if the card looks washed out"
msgstr "卡片及其包装盒的涂装效果。屏幕和色彩设置不同；如果卡片看起来褪色，请调低亮度。"

msgid "Welcome Shown"
msgstr "欢迎语显示"

msgid "The hello has been said once already"
msgstr "问候语已显示一次"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Discord"
msgstr "Discord"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "欢迎"

msgid "Show the welcome message again"
msgstr "再次显示欢迎消息"

msgid "Auto Unwrap: thank you. Feedback is very welcome on Discord: https://discord.gg/EC8d7nPsYj"
msgstr "自动展开：谢谢。欢迎在 Discord 提供反馈：https://discord.gg/EC8d7nPsYj"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Switch Panel"
msgstr "切换面板"

msgid "Move between the viewport card and the plain sidebar panel"
msgstr "在视图卡和平滑侧边栏面板之间切换"

msgid "Auto Unwrap v2"
msgstr "自动展开 v2"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Switch to the card"
msgstr "切换到卡片视图"

msgid "Engine missing for this system"
msgstr "此系统缺少引擎"

msgid "Smart Segmentation not enabled"
msgstr "智能分割未启用"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Hide Parts"
msgstr "隐藏部件"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Show Parts"
msgstr "显示部件"

msgid "%d parts picked"
msgstr "已选择 %d 个部件"

msgid "Click a part in the viewport"
msgstr "在视图中点击一个部件"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Confirm Merge"
msgstr "确认合并"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Pick & Merge Parts"
msgstr "拾取与合并部件"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Merge Selected"
msgstr "合并选中项"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Split"
msgstr "拆分"

msgid "Parts edited by hand"
msgstr "手动编辑的部件"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Hide Seams Preview"
msgstr "隐藏接缝预览"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Preview Seams"
msgstr "预览接缝"

msgid "Version v2"
msgstr "版本 v2"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Show Seam Map"
msgstr "显示接缝图"

msgid "Shade the model in clay: darker spots are hidden creases where seams are welcome, the light surface is where they are avoided"
msgstr "用粘土着色模型：较暗的区域是隐藏的折痕（即接缝所在之处），较亮的表面则是避免接缝的位置"

msgid "Seam map ready in %.1fs"
msgstr "接缝图已就绪，耗时 %.1fs"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Match Existing UV"
msgstr "匹配现有的 UV 贴图"

msgid "Read the seams out of a UV map the model already has and unwrap along them. The pieces come out where the artist who made that map put them, flattened by this engine and packed with our texel density and UDIM tiles. For a model that arrived with a layout worth keeping, or a retopology that has to match one"
msgstr "从模型已有的 UV 贴图中读取接缝，并沿着它们进行展开。生成的片段会在制作该贴图的艺术家放置的位置出现，经过此引擎展平并以我们的纹理密度和 UDIM 瓦片进行打包。对于拥有值得保留布局的模型，或需要匹配某个拓扑结构的模型"

msgid "This model has no other UV map to read"
msgstr "此模型没有其他 UV 贴图可供读取"

msgid "'%s' has no seams to read"
msgstr "%s 没有可读取的接缝"

msgid "Auto Unwrap: {props.status}"
msgstr "自动展开：{props.status}"

msgid "Show the Smart Segmentation parts of the active model as checker patterns, so you can tune them before unwrapping. Click again to hide"
msgstr "在视图中将活动模型的智能分割部分显示为棋盘格图案，以便您在展开前调整它们。再次点击以隐藏"

msgid "Click parts in the viewport to fuse them: the first click picks the part to merge into, every next click adds one. Click a merged part again to take it back. Enter keeps the result, Esc cancels"
msgstr "在视图中点击部分进行融合：第一次点击选择要合并的目标部分，每次后续点击添加一个。再次点击已合并的部分可将其取消。按 Enter 保持结果，Esc 取消"

msgid "Pick at least two parts"
msgstr "至少选择两个部分"

msgid "%d parts merged into one, %d parts left"
msgstr "%d 个部分已合并为一个，剩余 %d 个部分"

msgid "Merge the parts picked so far (same as pressing Enter in the viewport)"
msgstr "合并到目前为止选择的各个部分（与在视图中按 Enter 键效果相同）"

msgid "Leave the parts as they were (same as pressing Esc in the viewport)"
msgstr "保持原样（与在视图中按 Esc 相同）"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Merge Parts"
msgstr "合并部件"

msgid "Merge the parts of the selected faces into one part, so no seam runs between them. One selected face per part is enough. The unwrap then uses these hand edited parts"
msgstr "将所选面的部分合并为一个整体，这样它们之间就不会有接缝。每个部分只需选择一张面即可。展开时，则使用这些手动编辑好的部分。"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Selection As Part"
msgstr "选择作为部分"

msgid "Make the selected faces a part of their own, so its border becomes a seam"
msgstr "将选定的面设为独立部分，使其边缘成为接缝"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Reset Parts"
msgstr "重置部件"

msgid "Throw the hand edits away and go back to the Smart Segmentation parts"
msgstr "删除手部编辑并返回到智能分割部分"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Pick Island on Model"
msgstr "模型中拾取岛屿"

msgid "Click islands on the model itself to choose them, then Enter to unwrap just those again at the current Seams setting. Esc cancels and changes nothing"
msgstr "点击模型上的岛屿以选择它们，然后按 Enter 在当前接缝设置下再次展开这些岛屿。Esc 取消操作且不更改任何内容。"

msgid "Could not redo that piece: %s"
msgstr "无法重新生成该片段：%s"

msgid "they share no edge on the mesh - they are separate pieces of geometry, so they can sit side by side in the UV but cannot be one island"
msgstr "它们之间没有共享边——它们是独立的几何体，因此可以在 UV 中并排排列，但不能作为一个岛。"

msgid "they only meet on %d edges shared by three or more faces, which cannot be flattened as one piece - weld or clean that border first"
msgstr "它们仅在 %d 条被三个或更多面共享的边上相遇，这些边无法展平为一个整体——请先焊接或清理该边界"

msgid "the flattening split them again along %d edges shared by three or more faces"
msgstr "展平操作会再次沿着 %d 条被三个或更多面共享的边将它们分开"

msgid "Blender's unwrap kept them apart"
msgstr "Blender 的展开功能将保持它们分离"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Join Into One"
msgstr "合并为单个岛屿"

msgid "Take the seams out between the islands picked so far and unwrap them as a single piece"
msgstr "移除已选中岛屿之间的接缝，并将它们作为一个整体进行展开"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Redo Selected"
msgstr "重新展开选定部分"

msgid "Unwrap the selected faces again at the current Seams setting and leave the rest of the layout alone. Select the island in the UV editor or the faces in the 3D view, then press this"
msgstr "在当前接缝设置下再次展开选定的面，并保留其余布局。在 UV 编辑器或 3D 视图中选择该岛屿，然后按此按钮"

msgid "Select the faces of the island first, in the UV editor or in Edit Mode"
msgstr "首先在 UV 编辑器或编辑模式下选择岛屿的面"

msgid "That is the whole model - use Unwrap instead"
msgstr "这是整个模型——请使用“展开”功能"

msgid "Nothing changed"
msgstr "没有任何变化"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Bake Texture"
msgstr "烘焙贴图"

msgid "Bake the model's material into an image that follows the new UV layout. With From Selected Object it bakes another selected model onto this one"
msgstr "将模型的材质烘焙为一张跟随新 UV 布局的图像。使用“从选定对象”可以将另一个选定的模型烘焙到该模型上"

msgid "No UV map to bake into, run Auto Unwrap first"
msgstr "没有可烘焙的 UV 映射，请先运行自动展开"

msgid "%s_Baked"
msgstr "%s_烘焙"

msgid "No graphics card is set up for Cycles, baking on the processor"
msgstr "未为 Cycles 设置图形卡，正在处理器上进行烘焙"

msgid "graphics card"
msgstr "图形卡"

msgid "A bake is already running"
msgstr "正在运行一个烘焙操作"

msgid "Bake failed: %s"
msgstr "烘焙失败：%s"

msgid ", %d tiles"
msgstr "，%d 个瓦片"

msgid "hanging strips found"
msgstr "悬挂的条带"

msgid "strips hanging out of their islands sewn back on"
msgstr "从岛屿上垂下的条带缝合回去"

msgid "thin strips could join their neighbour"
msgstr "细条可以连接它们的邻居"

msgid "thin strips joined to the panel beside them"
msgstr "细条连接到它们旁边的面板"

msgid "thin strips could lie along the sheet"
msgstr "细条可以沿着板子平铺"

msgid "thin strips laid along the sheet"
msgstr "细条沿板子铺设"

msgid "cuts could be mirrored to the other half"
msgstr "切口可以镜像到另一半"

msgid "cuts mirrored to the other half"
msgstr "切口镜像到另一半"

msgid "bent panels could be cut at their rounded edges"
msgstr "弯曲的面板可以在其圆角处切割"

msgid "bent panels cut at their rounded edges"
msgstr "弯曲的面板在圆角处切割"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Smart UV (Blender)"
msgstr "智能 UV（Blender）"

msgid "Unwrap with Blender's Smart UV Project, one part at a time. For busy hard-surface models where the organic unwrap is not worth its time"
msgstr "使用 Blender 的智能 UV 展开，一次处理一个部分。对于繁忙的硬表面模型，有机 UV 展开不值得花费时间"

msgid "Smart UV: %d parts, %d islands, %.0fs"
msgstr "智能 UV：%d 个部分，%d 个岛屿，%.0fs"

msgid "attach"
msgstr "附加"

msgid "mirror"
msgstr "镜像"

msgid "psplit"
msgstr "分割"

msgid "stripaxis"
msgstr "删除轴"

msgid "Smart UV failed: %s"
msgstr "智能 UV 失败：%s"

msgid "Smart UV: %s, %.0fs"
msgstr "智能 UV：%s, %.0fs"

msgid "choosing the cuts"
msgstr "选择切割"

msgid "checking the shapes"
msgstr "检查形状"

msgid "merging the chips"
msgstr "合并芯片"

msgid "tidying up"
msgstr "整理"

msgid "squaring the panels"
msgstr "将面板正方形化"

msgid "breaking up what sprawls"
msgstr "打破蔓延的部分"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Repack"
msgstr "重新打包"

msgid "Pack the whole layout again with Blender's own packer, every selected object together. Use it after redoing islands by hand: the new pieces are placed properly with the rest. Every island stays in the UDIM tile it belongs to and the whole selection comes out at one texel density"
msgstr "使用 Blender 自带的打包器将整个布局重新打包，所有选中的对象一起打包。在手动重新生成岛屿后使用：新放置的部件将与其余部分正确对齐。每个岛屿仍保留在其所属的 UDIM 瓦片中，整个选择将以一种纹理密度输出"

msgid "Select a mesh"
msgstr "选择一个网格"

msgid "Repack failed: %s"
msgstr "重新打包失败：%s"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Relax UVs"
msgstr "放松 UV"

msgid "Flatten every island again along its existing seams to even out stretch and checker size. Seams stay where they are"
msgstr "再次沿现有接缝展平每个岛屿，使拉伸和棋盘格大小均匀化。接缝保持在原位"

msgid "No UV map to relax, run Auto Unwrap first"
msgstr "没有 UV 贴图可松弛，请先运行自动展开"

msgid "Auto Unwrap: UVs relaxed"
msgstr "自动展开：UV 已松弛"

msgid "Stop the run that is going on now"
msgstr "停止当前正在进行的运行"

msgid "Show or hide the seams as glowing orange lines in the viewport"
msgstr "在视口中显示或隐藏接缝为发光的橙色线条"

msgid "Seam preview: no seams on the selected model yet"
msgstr "接缝预览：选定的模型上尚无接缝"

msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Garment Seams"
msgstr "服装接缝"

msgid "Cut a clean quad garment the way an artist does - straight edge loops round the tubes and straight lines between them - then unwrap and pack. First version, built on shirts. Esc cancels"
msgstr "像艺术家那样裁剪干净的四边形服装——围绕管子的直线边缘环和它们之间的直线——然后展开并打包。第一个版本，基于衬衫构建。Esc 取消"
